WEBVTT

00:11.530 --> 00:12.440
<b>Stop that!</b>

00:12.440 --> 00:13.280
<b>Oro?</b>

00:13.280 --> 00:16.370
<b>Don't be chopping wood right next
to someone doing practice swings!</b>

00:16.370 --> 00:18.080
<b>It throws me off rhythm!</b>

00:18.280 --> 00:20.410
<b>You say that, but that is—</b>

00:20.410 --> 00:22.410
<b>If you're gonna do that,
at least use an axe!</b>

00:22.750 --> 00:24.290
<b>And what's with this perfect cut?</b>

00:24.290 --> 00:27.040
<b>Don't use a master's skill
on helping out with household chores!</b>

00:27.210 --> 00:29.300
<b>You don't even teach me any of it!</b>

00:29.300 --> 00:31.130
<b>- Stop arguing!
- Oro?</b>

00:31.920 --> 00:34.550
<b>There's no more need to fight!</b>

00:34.550 --> 00:36.590
<b>We can live in peace from now on!</b>

00:37.220 --> 00:38.970
<b>What is the matter, that is?</b>

00:38.970 --> 00:41.060
<b>Has her ugliness
gone up to her brain, too?</b>

00:43.560 --> 00:47.770
<b>I meant the worries about life expenses
that were my present concern are gone now!</b>

00:48.020 --> 00:50.610
<b>I was clearing out the closet
when I found this!</b>

00:51.360 --> 00:52.740
<b>Something my grandpa drew—</b>

00:52.740 --> 00:53.690
<b>A scribble?</b>

00:53.690 --> 00:55.240
<b>An ink painting!</b>

00:55.740 --> 00:58.530
<b>My grandpa was a swordsman,</b>

00:58.530 --> 01:00.700
<b>but at the same time,
a pretty popular ink artist.</b>

01:00.950 --> 01:03.330
<b>Selling this will get us money.</b>

01:03.330 --> 01:05.710
<b>Oh, thank you so much, Grandpa!</b>

01:05.920 --> 01:07.370
<b>What a calculating woman.</b>

01:10.840 --> 01:12.460
<b>Hmm? What is it?</b>

01:13.510 --> 01:15.220
<b>O-Ouch!</b>

01:15.220 --> 01:18.970
<b>And so, we can go to a beef
hot-pot restaurant for a fancy lunch!</b>

01:18.970 --> 01:22.930
<b>You act so high and mighty when others
are acting humble, you ugly hag!</b>

01:22.930 --> 01:25.390
<b>Whenever you say anything,
it's ugly this, ugly hag that.</b>

01:25.390 --> 01:26.980
<b>Is that the only thing you can think—</b>

01:26.980 --> 01:29.980
<b>- What was that?
- Good grief, that is.</b>

02:59.950 --> 03:03.950
<b>EPISODE 4:
THE FIGHTER FOR HIRE -
SANOSUKE SAGARA</b>

03:05.530 --> 03:10.160
<b><i>The Meiji enlightenment had a tremendous
impact on food culture as well.</i></b>

03:07.160 --> 03:08.660
<b>SUSHI</b>

03:08.660 --> 03:10.160
<b>TEMPURA</b>

03:10.160 --> 03:14.420
<b>BEEF HOT-POT AND SAKE
AKABEKO RESTAURANT</b>

03:10.160 --> 03:14.420
<b><i>All sorts of new dishes
came to life in this era.</i></b>

03:14.540 --> 03:16.460
<b><i>Of which, the beef hot-pot,</i></b>

03:16.460 --> 03:20.420
<b><i>what we call sukiyaki in modern day,
became immensely popular</i></b>

03:20.420 --> 03:24.300
<b><i>as a representative of Western cuisine
that common folk could eat.</i></b>

03:25.850 --> 03:26.760
<b>No good!</b>

03:27.180 --> 03:31.140
<b>A world of free democracy
will never come like that!</b>

03:31.310 --> 03:34.860
<b>But that means this is the same
as sending Mr. Itagaki to death!</b>

03:34.860 --> 03:37.530
<b>That's right!
Okubo, the Lord of Home Affairs,</b>

03:37.530 --> 03:39.900
<b>didn't show any mercy,
even to the Great Saigo!</b>

03:40.110 --> 03:41.860
<b>Enough of Okubo!</b>

03:41.860 --> 03:45.280
<b>If he can die and join the stars like
the Great Saigo, Mr. Itagaki can, too!</b>

03:45.280 --> 03:48.830
<b>Nonsense! What merit is there
in romanticism of that nature?</b>

03:49.200 --> 03:50.200
<b>Welcome—</b>

03:50.700 --> 03:52.160
<b>Oh, Kaoru.</b>

03:52.580 --> 03:54.670
<b>It's been a while, Ms. Tae.</b>

03:54.670 --> 03:56.500
<b>I'm glad you're doing well.</b>

03:57.090 --> 03:58.960
<b>Is this young man your boyfriend?</b>

03:59.380 --> 04:02.260
<b>He is not! He's just a guest of the dojo!</b>

04:05.470 --> 04:08.760
<b>If Mr. Itagaki dies,
then freedom dies with him!</b>

04:08.760 --> 04:10.060
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

04:10.060 --> 04:12.940
<b>Even if Mr. Itagaki dies,
freedom will not!</b>

04:13.230 --> 04:15.900
<b>Moreover, the way he dies
will enlighten the people!</b>

04:16.020 --> 04:19.360
<b>I guess they are activists for the
Democratic Rights Movement, that they are.</b>

04:17.900 --> 04:20.610
<b>And I'm saying that is romanticism!</b>

04:19.530 --> 04:22.610
<b>They're saying stuff
that I don't quite understand.</b>

04:22.820 --> 04:24.450
<b>Those are just drunks.</b>

04:24.950 --> 04:26.740
<b>Oh, don't worry about them.</b>

04:26.740 --> 04:29.080
<b>Shall I prepare enough for three for now?</b>

04:29.080 --> 04:31.700
<b>Oh, and three coffees, please.</b>

04:31.950 --> 04:34.370
<b>You are in good spirits,
Miss Kaoru, that you—</b>

04:35.250 --> 04:36.580
<b>Kenshin?</b>

04:37.380 --> 04:38.210
<b>Kenshin!</b>

04:38.630 --> 04:40.710
<b>Ororo...</b>

04:41.050 --> 04:43.010
<b>You can try saying that to me again!</b>

04:43.130 --> 04:46.090
<b>You threw a bottle at someone!
What are you arguing about over there?</b>

04:46.640 --> 04:49.050
<b>Put all that aside,
and apologize first, damn it!</b>

04:49.260 --> 04:50.760
<b>Kid, you're a century too young</b>

04:50.760 --> 04:55.020
<b>to speak to us
Democratic Rights Movement activists!</b>

04:55.310 --> 04:56.770
<b>It don't matter if I'm a kid!</b>

04:56.770 --> 04:58.860
<b>You gotta apologize, damn drunks!</b>

04:59.360 --> 05:00.480
<b>There, there.</b>

05:00.860 --> 05:02.610
<b>Who you calling drunks?</b>

05:02.610 --> 05:04.320
<b>We are Democratic Rights—</b>

05:04.320 --> 05:05.280
<b>Shut up!</b>

05:05.280 --> 05:07.280
<b>Everyone becomes a drunk
once they booze it up!</b>

05:07.530 --> 05:08.530
<b>What?</b>

05:08.530 --> 05:11.990
<b>S-Sirs, please don't make a fuss.</b>

05:12.120 --> 05:13.500
<b>Shut up!</b>

05:13.500 --> 05:15.540
<b>- Ms. Tae!
- Whoa!</b>

05:16.750 --> 05:21.130
<b>Democratic rights are for the sake
of the weak, ain't they?</b>

05:21.380 --> 05:25.340
<b>Activists clamorin' for that
shouldn't be doin' stuff like this.</b>

05:26.930 --> 05:28.260
<b>Or is it that...</b>

05:28.510 --> 05:33.600
<b>the democratic rights you speak of
are to get drunk and thrash about?</b>

05:33.970 --> 05:35.730
<b>What was that, punk?</b>

05:35.730 --> 05:37.390
<b>Are you picking a fight with us?</b>

05:38.690 --> 05:40.230
<b>Oh, right.</b>

05:40.230 --> 05:42.230
<b>I should pick one every so often.</b>

05:42.780 --> 05:45.360
<b>People usually pick fights with me, but...</b>

05:45.990 --> 05:50.200
<b>I really hate seeing someone be a bully
or being a bully myself.</b>

05:50.570 --> 05:51.410
<b>Especially...</b>

05:52.120 --> 05:53.660
<b>hypocrites bullying people</b>

05:53.660 --> 05:58.250
<b>while mouthing off
about freedom, justice, and equality.</b>

05:58.540 --> 06:00.960
<b>They piss me off to no end!</b>

06:01.090 --> 06:02.590
<b>Come outside with us!</b>

06:06.970 --> 06:08.930
<b>This is getting really weird.</b>

06:09.470 --> 06:11.550
<b>Would it be better to stop them, that is?</b>

06:11.800 --> 06:14.350
<b>They're sayin' they wanna do it,
so leave 'em.</b>

06:15.350 --> 06:17.100
<b>First, let's see what you can do.</b>

06:17.770 --> 06:19.310
<b>How about you land a good blow?</b>

06:21.440 --> 06:22.440
<b>You brat!</b>

06:22.570 --> 06:23.440
<b>Take this!</b>

06:25.440 --> 06:27.950
<b>That's not fair! He was hiding a suntetsu!</b>

06:28.200 --> 06:29.240
<b>Quit your barkin'!</b>

06:29.240 --> 06:31.910
<b>Suntetsu is a hidden weapon to begin with!</b>

06:33.280 --> 06:35.620
<b>What they are saying is correct,
that it is.</b>

06:36.950 --> 06:37.830
<b>However...</b>

06:38.790 --> 06:40.000
<b>it is not effective at all.</b>

06:43.460 --> 06:46.090
<b>This is all you can do,
even with a suntetsu?</b>

06:46.380 --> 06:47.670
<b>What?</b>

06:47.880 --> 06:49.010
<b>H-Hey...</b>

06:49.510 --> 06:51.890
<b>that right hand of yours...</b>

06:57.520 --> 07:00.520
<b>P-Punk! What the hell did you do?</b>

07:00.730 --> 07:02.730
<b>I didn't really do anything.</b>

07:02.940 --> 07:04.770
<b>A-Are you okay?</b>

07:04.770 --> 07:06.400
<b>Oh, this ain't much!</b>

07:06.400 --> 07:07.650
<b>If this disheartens me,</b>

07:07.650 --> 07:10.030
<b>I can't serve
as a Democratic Rights Movement activist!</b>

07:10.030 --> 07:12.320
<b>Oh, that's an admirable spirit!</b>

07:12.660 --> 07:16.080
<b>If I give it everything I got,
I will end up bullying you all.</b>

07:16.080 --> 07:18.290
<b>I'll take you on with one finger.</b>

07:18.500 --> 07:20.040
<b>Don't mock me!</b>

07:20.040 --> 07:21.080
<b>Take this!</b>

07:29.380 --> 07:31.760
<b>I sure picked a boring fight.</b>

07:32.550 --> 07:34.220
<b>One flick to the forehead...</b>

07:36.100 --> 07:36.930
<b>Damn it!</b>

07:36.930 --> 07:40.680
<b>I would have let things slide
if it was just a drunken fight...</b>

07:41.140 --> 07:45.400
<b>but if you're going to draw something
like that, I won't hold back, either.</b>

07:46.900 --> 07:49.400
<b>Democratic rights are perfectly fine.</b>

07:49.990 --> 07:51.740
<b>But in your case...</b>

07:52.150 --> 07:54.160
<b>before you correct the government,</b>

07:54.160 --> 07:56.780
<b>you need to correct yourselves,
that you do.</b>

07:57.830 --> 07:59.950
<b>Pay your bill, and go on home.</b>

08:04.500 --> 08:06.380
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

08:06.380 --> 08:07.920
<b>You helped me out there.</b>

08:08.170 --> 08:10.630
<b>Oh, that was a fight I chose to fight.</b>

08:10.630 --> 08:12.130
<b>It's nothing to be thanked over.</b>

08:12.880 --> 08:14.130
<b>Hey, swordsman.</b>

08:14.550 --> 08:16.350
<b>Is your head doin' all right?</b>

08:16.350 --> 08:17.350
<b>Hmm?</b>

08:17.350 --> 08:19.720
<b>Oh, it wasn't much of anything,
that it wasn't.</b>

08:19.930 --> 08:21.270
<b>Figures.</b>

08:21.270 --> 08:23.690
<b>If you intentionally didn't dodge it
and got badly hurt,</b>

08:23.690 --> 08:24.940
<b>you'd embarrass yourself.</b>

08:25.150 --> 08:25.980
<b>Huh?</b>

08:26.650 --> 08:29.190
<b>If you had dodged it back there,</b>

08:29.190 --> 08:31.990
<b>that girl's face
would be covered in blood by now.</b>

08:32.650 --> 08:36.530
<b>So you chose not to dodge it
and used your own head as a shield.</b>

08:36.870 --> 08:38.700
<b>You're overestimating me, that you are.</b>

08:38.700 --> 08:40.370
<b>You're being so humble.</b>

08:40.580 --> 08:42.620
<b>That suits my fancy.</b>

08:42.620 --> 08:44.120
<b>Won't you accept my challenge?</b>

08:44.540 --> 08:46.330
<b>I will decline, that I do.</b>

08:46.830 --> 08:48.590
<b>I see.</b>

08:48.590 --> 08:51.170
<b>Well, if you ever feel like it,
you can accept it whenever.</b>

08:51.170 --> 08:54.340
<b>I'll be over at the Gorotsuki Nagaya
on the outskirts of town.</b>

08:54.550 --> 08:55.630
<b>See ya.</b>

08:56.590 --> 09:05.020
<b>BAD</b>

09:00.390 --> 09:01.770
<b>What was with him?</b>

09:02.270 --> 09:05.020
<b>Is he a good guy or bad guy?</b>

09:05.190 --> 09:07.860
<b>That "bad" must mean bad taste.</b>

09:08.860 --> 09:10.440
<b><i>A strange man.</i></b>

09:11.190 --> 09:12.320
<b>By the way...</b>

09:12.320 --> 09:14.240
<b>Do you know something, Ms. Tae?</b>

09:14.820 --> 09:17.660
<b>He didn't pay his bill.</b>

09:21.700 --> 09:23.160
<b>Hmph.</b>

09:23.160 --> 09:26.670
<b>So you want me
to go defeat that guy?</b>

09:26.670 --> 09:30.380
<b>SA</b>

09:26.830 --> 09:30.380
<b>I'm sure you will be able
to get rid of him.</b>

09:30.540 --> 09:33.510
<b>Don't talk like I'm a hitman.</b>

09:33.510 --> 09:36.050
<b>It's all right with me
as long as I can enjoy my fights.</b>

09:39.300 --> 09:42.970
<b>But I'm surprised you guys
were able to escape from jail.</b>

09:43.100 --> 09:46.020
<b>That shows how much hatred I have.</b>

09:46.390 --> 09:50.360
<b>If he wasn't around,
everything would have gone well.</b>

09:50.360 --> 09:53.070
<b>A pathetic resentment you've got there.</b>

09:53.570 --> 09:56.780
<b>So is this Kenshin guy strong?</b>

09:58.740 --> 10:00.740
<b>I had really boring fights
yesterday and today,</b>

10:00.740 --> 10:02.200
<b>so I'm getting fed up with things.</b>

10:02.200 --> 10:03.080
<b>Strong!</b>

10:04.040 --> 10:07.710
<b>So much that he defeated me with one blow!</b>

10:07.710 --> 10:11.090
<b>You putz!
Defeating you ain't proof of strength,</b>

10:11.090 --> 10:13.000
<b>even if you do it
tens of thousands of times!</b>

10:13.960 --> 10:17.510
<b>Now, now... if you can lend us an ear...</b>

10:19.090 --> 10:22.180
<b>This man named Kenshin is actually...</b>

10:24.810 --> 10:26.430
<b>Come on, is that for real?</b>

10:26.430 --> 10:28.810
<b>How about it, Mr. Zanza?</b>

10:29.230 --> 10:32.900
<b>I'm sure that he will surely
prove sufficient as your opponent.</b>

10:33.650 --> 10:34.570
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:35.230 --> 10:39.280
<b>For the first time in several years,
he's someone worthy of using my "partner."</b>

10:39.860 --> 10:42.990
<b>The legendary manslayer, Himura Battosai!</b>

10:44.030 --> 10:48.870
<b>Zanza, fighter for hire, I've been
looking for tough guys like that!</b>

10:49.960 --> 10:52.960
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

10:52.960 --> 10:54.920
<b>SA</b>

10:55.630 --> 10:59.430
<b>"The legendary manslayer,
Himura Battosai!</b>

10:59.430 --> 11:05.100
<b>Zanza, fighter for hire, I've been
looking for tough guys like that!"</b>

11:05.350 --> 11:08.180
<b>Or so he said and trudged out
two weeks ago!</b>

11:08.180 --> 11:10.560
<b>Where in hell did that bird head go?</b>

11:10.730 --> 11:14.440
<b>He can't possibly
have chickened out and ran away?</b>

11:14.650 --> 11:19.150
<b>"It's all right with me as long
as I can enjoy my fights," he said!</b>

11:19.740 --> 11:21.160
<b>Give me a break!</b>

11:22.070 --> 11:24.200
<b>You're the one
that's gonna give me a break!</b>

11:24.200 --> 11:27.660
<b>If you're doing weird impersonations,
I'll hang you upside down!</b>

11:27.870 --> 11:31.620
<b>O-O-Oh, Mr. Zanza. Where have you been?</b>

11:31.830 --> 11:33.460
<b>Fights. I've been fighting.</b>

11:33.460 --> 11:35.290
<b>Another fight?</b>

11:35.290 --> 11:36.710
<b>No way, putz.</b>

11:37.170 --> 11:40.300
<b>A fight doesn't start
with punches and kicks.</b>

11:40.800 --> 11:43.760
<b>Though you lot wouldn't understand,
even if I told you.</b>

11:47.890 --> 11:50.060
<b>Zanza, fighter for hire.</b>

11:50.060 --> 11:51.890
<b>A guy that fights for you,</b>

11:51.890 --> 11:54.810
<b>known throughout
the underground society of eastern Tokyo.</b>

11:54.810 --> 11:58.030
<b>His fight money is decided
by how much he has fun.</b>

11:58.030 --> 12:01.240
<b>An irresponsible, ultracheeky lone wolf.</b>

12:01.240 --> 12:09.660
<b>BAD</b>

12:01.360 --> 12:02.990
<b>However, he is strong!</b>

12:02.990 --> 12:05.910
<b>Those that fight him
are said to have nightmares</b>

12:05.910 --> 12:09.660
<b>about the "bad" on his back
for months on end.</b>

12:10.080 --> 12:15.500
<b>If I make good use of Zanza,
I can surely do that aggravating guy in...</b>

12:15.500 --> 12:18.590
<b>that Himura Battosai!</b>

12:21.470 --> 12:22.680
<b>We have a guest, that we do.</b>

12:22.880 --> 12:25.430
<b>Huh? H-Hold on, Kenshin.</b>

12:25.430 --> 12:26.760
<b>What? What's going on?</b>

12:27.430 --> 12:29.010
<b>I felt a presence, that I did.</b>

12:30.220 --> 12:31.980
<b>Not even trying to hide it...</b>

12:32.770 --> 12:34.650
<b>a stupidly straightforward battle aura.</b>

12:36.900 --> 12:39.280
<b>I'm here to fight.</b>

12:39.480 --> 12:40.990
<b>That guy from the other day!</b>

12:40.990 --> 12:42.650
<b>So it was you.</b>

12:43.200 --> 12:46.200
<b>I thought I declined on fighting you,
that I did.</b>

12:46.620 --> 12:48.200
<b>But I can't let that slide.</b>

12:48.410 --> 12:50.870
<b>This is a fight I'm picking
as a fighter for hire.</b>

12:51.160 --> 12:52.370
<b>All the more reason</b>

12:52.370 --> 12:55.580
<b>if I'm going against
the Imperialist, Himura Battosai.</b>

12:59.090 --> 13:02.340
<b>Imperialist from Choshu, Himura Battosai.</b>

13:02.840 --> 13:06.390
<b>Your sword style is the ancient sword art
Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu.</b>

13:06.590 --> 13:10.100
<b>You worked for five years,
from age 14 to 19.</b>

13:10.310 --> 13:12.520
<b>You spent the first half
as a literal manslayer,</b>

13:12.520 --> 13:15.230
<b>a merciless assassin
squirming in the shadows.</b>

13:15.480 --> 13:18.610
<b>In the second half,
you were a commando swordsman</b>

13:18.610 --> 13:21.360
<b>protecting comrades
from the Shogunate's swordsmen.</b>

13:22.400 --> 13:26.110
<b>You're famous to this day
because of the second job.</b>

13:26.950 --> 13:30.910
<b>However, you went missing
after the victory at Toba-Fushimi.</b>

13:31.410 --> 13:35.920
<b>And now you live your days
as the rurouni Kenshin Himura.</b>

13:36.290 --> 13:40.040
<b>A real fight begins
by learning more about your opponent.</b>

13:40.630 --> 13:43.130
<b>And you decide how to fight
after you gain knowledge.</b>

13:43.880 --> 13:46.470
<b>I went all the way to Kyoto
to do some research.</b>

13:47.340 --> 13:50.470
<b>So have you decided
how to fight, that you have?</b>

13:50.720 --> 13:52.470
<b>That's just it! That's my problem!</b>

13:53.220 --> 13:55.810
<b>I only figured out your general history.</b>

13:56.060 --> 13:59.360
<b>What kind of sword style
is Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu?</b>

13:59.690 --> 14:03.320
<b>Why did a merciless manslayer
turn into a rurouni that refuses to kill?</b>

14:03.820 --> 14:06.400
<b>I couldn't figure out
any of the key details.</b>

14:06.900 --> 14:08.410
<b>And since I couldn't figure it out,</b>

14:08.410 --> 14:12.030
<b>I came here like this
to fight you fair and square.</b>

14:14.250 --> 14:15.700
<b>Hey, Bro...</b>

14:16.000 --> 14:19.670
<b>do you think Zanza can really win?</b>

14:19.670 --> 14:22.420
<b>Hmph. He's facing the Battosai.</b>

14:22.420 --> 14:24.000
<b>Of course it will be impossible.</b>

14:25.090 --> 14:26.470
<b>Then—</b>

14:26.470 --> 14:27.970
<b>Fret not.</b>

14:28.220 --> 14:29.720
<b>Zanza will lose.</b>

14:30.220 --> 14:33.260
<b>But he is a famous fighter for hire.</b>

14:33.260 --> 14:34.600
<b>Even if it costs him his life,</b>

14:34.600 --> 14:37.560
<b>he will wound Battosai
and force a difficult battle.</b>

14:37.940 --> 14:40.520
<b>When that battle ends
and Battosai is caught off guard,</b>

14:40.520 --> 14:43.480
<b>I will put an end to him.</b>

14:43.820 --> 14:46.360
<b>With this, that I bought over in Yokohama!</b>

14:48.240 --> 14:49.570
<b>I don't get it, either.</b>

14:49.570 --> 14:50.410
<b>Huh?</b>

14:50.660 --> 14:54.030
<b>You hate watching
or being part of bullying.</b>

14:54.160 --> 14:57.450
<b>Then why are you a fighter for hire?
That is quite an irrational career path.</b>

14:58.250 --> 15:02.960
<b>Why do you so openly carry
the word "bad" on your back?</b>

15:03.170 --> 15:05.210
<b>You have
a very straightforward personality,</b>

15:05.710 --> 15:08.550
<b>but your current self is terribly warped.</b>

15:08.760 --> 15:11.930
<b>What got you so badly warped
into how you are now, that is?</b>

15:12.640 --> 15:14.010
<b>What did...</b>

15:18.770 --> 15:20.100
<b>Forget it.</b>

15:21.020 --> 15:24.570
<b>If you really wanna know,
you gotta fight me and win!</b>

15:24.900 --> 15:27.070
<b>But let me say this.</b>

15:27.650 --> 15:33.490
<b>I think every Imperialist is a hypocrite
that I hate, oh, so much.</b>

15:34.370 --> 15:36.910
<b>Under the name of justice,
they do whatever they want.</b>

15:37.410 --> 15:42.460
<b>They warp the truth to look down on
and crush anyone that gets in their way.</b>

15:43.210 --> 15:45.170
<b>Equality for the four classes?</b>

15:45.170 --> 15:47.130
<b>That's such a huge lie
that it makes me laugh!</b>

15:47.340 --> 15:49.340
<b>So the legendary manslayer</b>

15:49.340 --> 15:51.840
<b>said to be the most powerful
among the Imperialists...</b>

15:52.090 --> 15:55.050
<b>I want to beat him up
from the bottom of my heart!</b>

16:01.690 --> 16:02.520
<b>All right.</b>

16:03.020 --> 16:04.060
<b>I will take you on.</b>

16:04.270 --> 16:05.360
<b>Kenshin!</b>

16:05.860 --> 16:07.940
<b>However, answer one question first.</b>

16:08.530 --> 16:11.700
<b>The Hiruma brothers are your clients
for this fight, are they not?</b>

16:12.240 --> 16:13.780
<b>Excellent guess.</b>

16:13.780 --> 16:14.950
<b>How'd you figure it out?</b>

16:15.450 --> 16:16.450
<b>Of course I can tell.</b>

16:16.950 --> 16:20.290
<b>There are only so many people in this town
that know of my background.</b>

16:20.500 --> 16:25.380
<b>Besides, their grimy, menacing auras
are wafting over from behind that gate.</b>

16:25.880 --> 16:27.880
<b>You don't need to hide. Come out.</b>

16:27.880 --> 16:31.130
<b>You are a top-class swordsman, after all.</b>

16:31.300 --> 16:34.010
<b>Hey, you can give up and come out now!</b>

16:35.430 --> 16:37.510
<b>We're telling you to show yourselves.</b>

16:44.440 --> 16:47.020
<b>There you go. That's how you should be.</b>

16:47.360 --> 16:49.020
<b>Now, hand it over.</b>

16:49.020 --> 16:50.150
<b>Huh?</b>

16:50.150 --> 16:51.650
<b>- Don't "Huh?" me.
- Oh!</b>

16:52.610 --> 16:53.990
<b>Just as I thought.</b>

16:54.610 --> 16:58.370
<b>I can totally see through what worthless
thugs like you would think about.</b>

16:58.580 --> 17:02.540
<b>Listen. You may have
picked this fight for me,</b>

17:02.540 --> 17:04.920
<b>but since I accepted, this is my fight.</b>

17:05.420 --> 17:07.000
<b>Stupid little interruptions...</b>

17:09.750 --> 17:12.010
<b>will never fly under my watch.</b>

17:13.300 --> 17:14.170
<b>Kihei.</b>

17:17.050 --> 17:21.310
<b>This property and building
will definitely be mine, little girl!</b>

17:26.980 --> 17:30.150
<b>The dojo is a bit cramped for my partner.</b>

17:30.570 --> 17:32.490
<b>Let's head out to the riverbank
or something.</b>

17:43.750 --> 17:45.710
<b><i>We're standing out.</i></b>

17:45.710 --> 17:47.210
<b>- Yahiko.
- Huh?</b>

17:47.540 --> 17:50.420
<b>Were you as surprised
as I expected you to be, that is?</b>

17:50.670 --> 17:51.710
<b>Well, yeah...</b>

17:52.210 --> 17:53.920
<b>but it hasn't really sunk in yet.</b>

17:53.920 --> 17:55.800
<b>You're not scary at all.</b>

17:56.180 --> 17:58.970
<b>More like I have a strange understanding</b>

17:58.970 --> 18:02.430
<b>that it's only natural
for you to be devilishly strong.</b>

18:04.520 --> 18:06.350
<b>Anyway, are you okay with this?</b>

18:06.560 --> 18:07.560
<b>Oro?</b>

18:07.560 --> 18:09.360
<b>Don't "Oro?" me.</b>

18:09.360 --> 18:11.440
<b>Look at that thing he's got.</b>

18:11.650 --> 18:14.030
<b>That length surely is that of a spear.</b>

18:14.150 --> 18:16.570
<b>I hear that in order
to go against a spear with a sword,</b>

18:16.610 --> 18:18.740
<b>you need about triple
the skill of your opponent.</b>

18:19.160 --> 18:20.990
<b>It's not a spear, kiddo.</b>

18:21.370 --> 18:23.660
<b>This is something better than that.</b>

18:25.910 --> 18:29.420
<b>Come to think of it, we haven't
introduced ourselves yet, have we?</b>

18:33.420 --> 18:36.050
<b>My name is Sanosuke Sagara.</b>

18:36.050 --> 18:38.430
<b>The underground society call me Zanza.</b>

18:39.130 --> 18:42.810
<b>Zanbato-wielding Sanosuke,
Zanza for short.</b>

18:43.680 --> 18:44.560
<b>Zanbato...</b>

18:46.140 --> 18:50.060
<b><i>Zanbato, a giant sword created
before the Sengoku Era</i></b>

18:50.060 --> 18:53.980
<b><i>to slay the enemy leader, horse and all.</i></b>

18:53.980 --> 18:59.490
<b><i>It is said that not one man ever
fully mastered using it due to its weight.</i></b>

18:59.490 --> 19:01.700
<b>Th-That's the rumored...</b>

19:02.200 --> 19:04.330
<b>Zanza's partner.</b>

19:04.620 --> 19:07.330
<b>It's an antique from around the Onin War.</b>

19:07.330 --> 19:09.330
<b>Its ability to cut is almost zero.</b>

19:09.830 --> 19:13.420
<b>But I can still crush something with it!</b>

19:13.960 --> 19:15.920
<b>Rurouni, Kenshin Himura.</b>

19:16.760 --> 19:18.470
<b>I will fight you with this blade.</b>

19:18.880 --> 19:21.180
<b>Though, knowing you,
I don't have to say that.</b>

19:21.680 --> 19:23.680
<b>I'm sure you already did your research.</b>

19:24.310 --> 19:27.640
<b>Yeah. So I have one word of advice.</b>

19:28.060 --> 19:31.440
<b>Do away with
that sappy thought of not killing.</b>

19:31.650 --> 19:33.190
<b>If you don't...</b>

19:33.440 --> 19:35.070
<b>you'll die!</b>

19:35.070 --> 19:35.980
<b>So fast!</b>

19:55.500 --> 19:56.920
<b>That's right.</b>

19:57.250 --> 20:01.590
<b>Even if his zanbato is amazing, it doesn't
mean anything if he can't hit with it!</b>

20:03.180 --> 20:05.010
<b>An overwhelming victory for Kenshin!</b>

20:10.180 --> 20:12.440
<b>You definitely are strong.</b>

20:12.440 --> 20:14.060
<b>No wonder you're a legend.</b>

20:15.440 --> 20:16.520
<b>But...</b>

20:16.860 --> 20:17.980
<b>Oh!</b>

20:18.900 --> 20:19.820
<b>This isn't good.</b>

20:20.610 --> 20:23.110
<b>We misjudged him.</b>

20:24.030 --> 20:29.410
<b>His true strength isn't his superior might
that defeats a giant man with one finger</b>

20:29.410 --> 20:33.370
<b>or the smashing of his Zanbato
that stems from his power.</b>

20:33.750 --> 20:35.880
<b>It's his ability to take abnormal hits,</b>

20:35.880 --> 20:39.380
<b>like not flinching at all from a suntetsu
hitting the middle of his forehead!</b>

20:39.840 --> 20:45.470
<b>Kenshin's Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu
has defeated every enemy with one blow.</b>

20:46.220 --> 20:49.680
<b>That one blow
doesn't work against this guy!</b>

20:53.100 --> 20:57.310
<b>A fight is different
from a swordfight that uses real blades.</b>

20:57.310 --> 20:59.610
<b>The one that is stronger
with the sword doesn't win.</b>

21:00.070 --> 21:02.820
<b>The guy that doesn't fall down wins!</b>

21:04.030 --> 21:05.740
<b>You should say that...</b>

21:06.120 --> 21:09.410
<b>only when you are
the last man standing, that you should.</b>

22:44.960 --> 22:49.970
<b>NEXT EPISODE
AND THEN, ANOTHER</b>

22:45.970 --> 22:49.010
<b><i>Next episode, "And Then, Another"</i></b>
